<title>USA: GOLF-RESULTS AT ANDERSEN CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-RESULTS AT ANDERSEN CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>KOHLER, Wisconsin 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>international regional of the Andersen Consulting World</p>
<p>Championship of Golf, played under matchplay rules at</p>
<p>Blackwolf Run River Course (par 72, 6,991 yards) on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix numbers denote seedings):</p>
<p>Regional final</p>
<p>Ernie Els (South Africa) beat Steve Elkington (Australia),</p>
<p>2-up</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Elkington beat Greg Norman (Australia), 2 and 1</p>
<p>Els beat Nick Price (Zimbabwe), 3 and 2</p>
</text>
